  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e02-scene-03",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "谁输了谁买单  (Whoever Loses Pays the Bill)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xie_ling": "谢灵",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Still in the evening lounge, Xie Ling gets ready to hurry off, until Chun Yuqiao stops him to warn him about planting informants inside Xingtian. Listen to their exchange.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "没什么事我先走了，我很忙。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "今天见面，我是想告诉你一件事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "以后不要再在我身边安插眼线了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "昨天的节目你也看了，你的眼线没用。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "淳于，你是很聪明。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这是最后一次。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你埋在我身边的眼线，我都拔掉了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "以前的事不算大问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "但是以后，希望你按规矩做事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你的作风，我比谁都清楚。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "老规矩，谁输了谁买单。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "来了，我买单！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's unpack the lines one by one. Xie Ling tries to leave first.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "没什么事我先走了，我很忙。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If there is nothing else I am leaving first; I am very busy.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "今天见面，我是想告诉你一件事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Meeting today, I wanted to tell you one thing.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "以后不要再在我身边安插眼线了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'From now on, stop planting informants around me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "昨天的节目你也看了，你的眼线没用。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You saw yesterday's show too; your informant was useless.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "淳于，你是很聪明。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chun Yu, you really are smart.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这是最后一次。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is the last time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你埋在我身边的眼线，我都拔掉了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Every informant you planted around me, I have already pulled out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "以前的事不算大问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What happened before does not count as a big problem.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "但是以后，希望你按规矩做事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'But from now on, I hope you do things by the rules.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你的作风，我比谁都清楚。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your style of working, I know better than anyone.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "老规矩，谁输了谁买单。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Old rule: whoever loses pays the bill.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "来了，我买单！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Coming — I will pay the bill!'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "没什么事我先走了，我很忙。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "今天见面，我是想告诉你一件事。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "以后不要再在我身边安插眼线了。",
      "gap": 0.5
